  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Honeycomb?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193524\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Honeycomb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Honeycomb</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal good</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 39</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 68</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  35 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Honey Bee</span><span title=\"Honey bee(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey Bee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 19</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Honeycomb</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal good</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 39.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/honey-15777\" title=\"Honey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/beeswax-16468\" title=\"Beeswax\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">beeswax</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/honey-soap-34837\" title=\"Honey Soap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey soap</a>.\n</p><p>Like all goods, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Collecting honeycomb</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025204515\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Honey bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey bee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Honey bee</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Beehive_Tree_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Beehive tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Beehive tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Honeycomb is collected from beehives in the <a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">beehive tree</a>.\n</p><p>To make one piece of honeycomb, <a href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey bees</a> need to gather 100 drops of nectar from <a href=\"/wiki/nectar-bush-15746\" title=\"Nectar Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nectar bushes</a> and bring them to the tree. This takes approximately 33 minutes if bushes are close enough to the tree. Honeycomb can then be collected immediately.\n</p><p>Collecting one piece of honeycomb gives players 8 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling honeycomb</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Honeycomb can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 684 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey bee</a> costs between 1,500 and 3,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and a <a href=\"/wiki/nectar-bush-15746\" title=\"Nectar Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nectar bush</a> costs 120 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">beehive tree</a> costs 4,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using honeycomb</b></span></h3>\n<p>Honeycomb is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/honey-15777\" title=\"Honey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/beeswax-16468\" title=\"Beeswax\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beeswax\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/honey-soap-34837\" title=\"Honey soap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey soap\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-tea-36214\" title=\"Chamomile tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile tea\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/honey-15777\" title=\"Honey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Honey</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/beeswax-16468\" title=\"Beeswax\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beeswax</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/honey-soap-34837\" title=\"Honey Soap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Honey Soap</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-tea-36214\" title=\"Chamomile Tea\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chamomile Tea</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193524\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193524\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193524\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025193524\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 39\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 48\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 84\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 100\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Recipes ask between 2&#160;and 3&#160;pieces of honeycomb.</li>\n<li>Honeycomb is very rare to be bought. You need to prepare some of it to make other recipes.</li>\n<li>Honeycomb gives low revenue that selling it is not recommended. Instead, you can use honeycomb to make honey or beeswax then sell it to get greater revenue.</li>\n<li>Honeycomb is never requested in <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> orders.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Skep.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025204403\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Skep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Skep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Skep</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>The woven straw basket used to collect honeycomb in the game is called a <b>skep</b>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon (35 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025193433\" title=\"Bacon (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Bacon (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-feather-17011\" title=\"Duck Feather (44 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f9/Duck_Feather.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150414212143\" title=\"Duck Feather (44 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Feather (44 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Egg (17 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/26/Egg.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025193420\" title=\"Egg (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Egg (17 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapp